name tile-graphic
category Package
revision 55325
shortdesc Create tiles of a graphical file
longdesc This package breaks a given graphical file into n rows and m
longdesc columns of subgraphics, which are called tiles. The tiles can
longdesc be written separately to individual PDF files, or packaged into
longdesc a single PDF file.
